{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y部分段落的感受词条仍然偏密，意象有时叠加过多；如果只求一眼扫过，X的左右分栏更直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用加亮短语把每段的核心钉住，又把不少感受安排在对应乐句出现，既有视觉层次，也更容易把文字和正在听到的音乐对上。更重要的是，它清楚地呈现了从怀念亲近、想起受气、害怕孤单，到不再依靠回头解决问题的心理推进，人物为什么动摇、为什么最终选择继续生活都有交代。X的双栏结构更方便速览，但部分感受比较概括，音乐细节和人物心理之间的联系不如Y具体。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "088fee7e-381b-4ab7-9769-a975f1c2208b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010923215001Z", "elapsed_seconds": 69.094, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:10:32.328059+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37d7e7e731470ff50c3a2c2b6a9f9a88abdd4720e58302ddd3b96241f6eb7bc0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py